<h1 id=3D"19-seed">19. Seed</h1><p>Seed adalah nilai awal generator angka p=
seudo-random.</p>
<p>Contoh:</p>
<pre><code class=3D"hljs language-plaintext">seed =3D 12345</code></pre><p>=
Seed memungkinkan procedural generation menjadi <strong>reproducible</stron=
g>:</p>
<pre><code class=3D"hljs language-plaintext">Seed sama
=E2=86=92 urutan random sama
=E2=86=92 dungeon sama</code></pre><p>Sedangkan:</p>
