<h1 id=3D"51-split-horizontal">51. Split Horizontal</h1><p>Tambahkan:</p>
<pre><code class=3D"hljs language-plaintext">private void SplitHorizontal(B=
SPNode node)
{
    if (node.height &lt; minLeafSize * 2)
