<h1 id=3D"91-validasi-dungeon">91. Validasi Dungeon</h1><p>Dungeon procedur=
al sebaiknya tidak langsung dianggap valid hanya karena terlihat benar.</p>
<p>Beberapa <strong>hard constraint</strong>:</p>
<pre><code class=3D"hljs language-plaintext">Room minimal satu.
Start tersedia.
Goal tersedia.
Start berada pada floor.
Goal berada pada floor.
Start dan Goal terhubung.</code></pre><p>Beberapa <strong>soft constraint</=
strong>:</p>
<pre><code class=3D"hljs language-plaintext">Start dan Goal cukup jauh.
Jumlah Enemy tidak terlalu banyak.
Item tersebar.
Room tidak terlalu kecil.
Dungeon tidak terlalu linear.</code></pre><hr>
<h1 id=3D"92-validasi-sederhana">92. Validasi Sederhana</h1><p>Tambahkan:</=
p>
<pre><code class=3D"hljs language-plaintext">private bool ValidateDungeon()
{
    if (rooms =3D=3D null || rooms.Count &lt; 2)
    {
        Debug.LogWarning(
            "Dungeon invalid: jumlah room terlalu sedikit."
        );

        return false;
    }

    if (!IsInsideGrid(
            startPosition.x,
            startPosition.y))
    {
        return false;
    }

    if (!IsInsideGrid(
            goalPosition.x,
            goalPosition.y))
    {
        return false;
    }

    return true;
}</code></pre><hr>
<h1 id=3D"93-validasi-konektivitas-dengan-bfs">93. Validasi Konektivitas de=
ngan BFS</h1><p>Versi lebih baik menggunakan:</p>
<h2 id=3D"breadth-first-search">Breadth-First Search</h2><p>Tujuan:</p>
<pre><code class=3D"hljs language-plaintext">Mulai dari Start
=E2=86=93
jelajahi seluruh Floor yang terhubung
=E2=86=93
apakah Goal ditemukan?</code></pre><p>Tambahkan:</p>
<pre><code class=3D"hljs language-plaintext">private bool HasPathToGoal()
{
    bool[,] visited =3D
        new bool[mapWidth, mapHeight];

    Queue&lt;Vector2Int&gt; queue =3D
        new Queue&lt;Vector2Int&gt;();

    queue.Enqueue(startPosition);

    visited[
        startPosition.x,
        startPosition.y
    ] =3D true;

    Vector2Int[] directions =3D
    {
        Vector2Int.up,
        Vector2Int.down,
        Vector2Int.left,
        Vector2Int.right
    };

    while (queue.Count &gt; 0)
    {
        Vector2Int current =3D
            queue.Dequeue();

        if (current =3D=3D goalPosition)
        {
            return true;
        }

        foreach (Vector2Int direction
                 in directions)
        {
            Vector2Int next =3D
                current + direction;

            if (!IsInsideGrid(
                    next.x,
                    next.y))
            {
                continue;
            }

            if (visited[
                    next.x,
                    next.y])
            {
                continue;
            }

            if (grid[
                    next.x,
                    next.y]
                =3D=3D TileType.Wall)
            {
                continue;
            }

            visited[
                next.x,
                next.y
            ] =3D true;

            queue.Enqueue(next);
        }
    }

    return false;
}</code></pre><hr>
